 Other<br>_Town cult complex_<br>In the 1st Dynasty there were probably cult temple compounds within towns which "served a different function from those associated with the funerary complexes, which were located outside the towns."<br>1.<br>2.<br>3.<br>\n                    '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 1215, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 1147})
